{"type": "answer", "text": "The Moss docs do not document a Rust SDK crate or a crates.io package name, so there is no cargo add command to give. The closest documented item is the native C library libmoss (v0.33.0), which the C SDK page says is distributed only as GitHub binary releases (release tag c-sdk-v0.33.0 at github.com/usemoss/moss/releases) and is not published to crates.io. Install it by downloading the tarball for your platform and linking with -lmoss, not with cargo."}
